168	/// Test D — SMA-414: guard rules, `default_guards`, `redact_output`, and
169	/// `extra_secrets` all propagate from the parent `ToolContext` into the
170	/// agent-as-tool sub-run's `RunContext`.
171	///
172	/// Strategy (lighter-probe): the wrapped agent is a `MockAgent` whose behavior
173	/// closure captures a shared `Arc<Mutex<...>>` and records the four values it
174	/// observes on the `RunContext` it receives. `AgentAsTool::invoke` is driven
175	/// directly via `RunContext::to_tool_context()` (the same idiom used in
